OL,3,APolice told Russell Brand to leave
OL,4,AJemima Goldsmith's house in 2014
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoldsmith, who dated Brand for about a
OL,7,Fyear, wrote on X on Monday that she
OL,8,F"had to call the police to have him
OL,9,Fremoved from my house in 2014 during a
OL,10,Fviolent incident" but chose not to
OL,11,Fpress charges.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
