OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle back in
OL,4,Afederal custody after allegedly
OL,5,Aremoving ankle monitor
OL,6,
OL,7,FMarkle, who has denied possessing
OL,8,Fimages of child sex abuse, was arrested
OL,9,Fin Florida last week and placed under
OL,10,Fhouse detention. He was also ordered to
OL,11,Fwear a location monitoring device.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
