OL,3,AVinicius Jr sends message to Sudan boy
OL,4,Awho received prosthetic legs after BBC
OL,5,Areport sparks appeal
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a dark room in Cairo, a 13-year-old
OL,8,Fboy looks up at a television screen,
OL,9,Fbarely blinking.
OL,11,FThe screen flickers and Real Madrid's
OL,12,Fsuperstar winger Vinicius Junior
OL,13,Fappears addressing the young boy
OL,14,Fdirectly, in Arabic: "Zaher, mahaba" -
OL,15,FHello Zaher.
OL,17,FZaher barely moves, his eyes wide,
OL,18,Flocked on his favourite footballer.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
