OL,3,AHeadquarters of Haitian gang destroyed,
OL,4,AEl Salvador's president says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe headquarters of one of Haiti's
OL,7,Flargest crime gangs has been destroyed
OL,8,Fby El Salvador's military, the
OL,9,FSalvadoran president has said.
OL,11,FThe infamous 400 Mawozo gang, which is
OL,12,Fknown for kidnappings and intimidation
OL,13,Ftactics, was targeted in a ground and
OL,14,Fair attack at a complex on the
OL,15,Foutskirts of Haiti's capital,
OL,16,FPort-au-Prince.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
